# The GM10's UART at 230400 baud, as POST check 9 configures it (ROADMAP 4.1): one second of the
# stream at a window, 2026-10-22, a 3D fix with 10 satellites used, 24 in NAV-SAT. Nothing but UBX:
# nine NAV-PVT at 10 Hz and the periodic NAV-SAT, between two of tools/gps-test's polls.
#
# Captured with tools/gps-test's raw dump. The position is not where it was taken: every NAV-PVT's
# latitude and longitude are moved by the same offset, the first epoch onto the project's sample
# point 45.1234560 N, 9.3456780 E (cell N4512E00934), and each frame's checksum is worked out again.
# Every other byte is the module's own.
